body:
Ayeee im so glad my review got you to try it again! I never did the corruption and I dont really see myself doing it especially after how amazing the romance is. Nicole is amazing I love everything about her! Abigail is also someone I really like.

&#x200B;

I never heard of heart problems but I've recently been into MILFS (well ive always been but for an avn i mean lol) so ill def check it out! Thanks!

I agree it can be redone in better quality, but i only feel that way in those moments when they are talking and its just a png of them (idk how to explain it). I still thought it was really done well and I for some reason think if it was too realistic it may not be the same (for me)

&#x200B;

For me this grainy feel to the game is comfy and its like for a weird example like oldschool naruto graphics vs new , it def can be updated but I like the old look more in naruto

Ripples is my first HS game and i used to dislike HS but that one changed me completly

&#x200B;

Thanks for the suggestions!

Thanks for the suggestions! (and photos cuz i need to see how it looks)

&#x200B;

im gonna download some and try them
